@@ -16,13 +16,13 @@ Instead of relying entirely on centralized server processing, the proposed syste
 Furthermore, the integration of location, time and rescue information for identifying and grouping related events is intended to reduce duplicate reports and support visualization of rescue situations on a digital map.
 
 \FormSection{4. Research results:}
-For image classification, the model was evaluated on a test set of 256 images. Using seed 1024, the model achieved \NewImageAccuracy\% accuracy and \NewImageMacroFOne\% macro-F1, with three critical errors. The structured pruning experiment achieved \PruningAccuracy\% accuracy, with \PruningCriticalCount{} critical errors.
+On 256 test images, the seed-1024 baseline achieved \NewImageAccuracy\% accuracy and \NewImageMacroFOne\% macro-F1 with three critical errors. Historical pruning reached \PruningAccuracy\% accuracy with \PruningCriticalCount{} critical errors; exact McNemar $p=0.1173$ did not establish improvement. An additional 5/10/20\% pruning grid selected 5\% using validation, but test macro-F1 fell to \LocalPrunedFOne\%. Partial PTQ/QAT tensor diagnostics have not isolated the cause of degradation.
 
 Additional ONNX CPU screening of the pruned model used the same 256 images and eight synthetic corruptions. Macro-F1 decreased from \QualityCleanMacroFOne\% on clean images to \QualityDarkMacroFOne\% at 0.4 brightness. This does not establish robustness on Android or field camera images; inherited corruption labels have not been re-adjudicated.
 
 The app sends image labels and the LR score for storage; the adapter uses urgency or description keywords for clustering/ranking. Five-flag LR fitted to synthetic OR labels is not free-text NLP. The English CrisisMMD informativeness pilot reaches text/fusion macro-F1 of \MMTextFOne\%/\MMFusionFOne\%; effect CIs include zero.
 
-A separate pilot uses AI-translated Vietnamese text and AI labels: \VISilverTrainN{} training, \VISilverDevN{} development and \VISilverTestN{} test pairs. Text classifiers, DistilBERT fine-tuning and frozen feature fusion were run offline; frozen fusion reaches \VISilverFusionFOne\% macro-F1 and \VISilverFusionRecall\% request recall. Labels derive from source text, not independent human gold. Native-Vietnamese evaluation and application fusion remain unfulfilled; information extraction and camera/Android evaluation remain proposed.
+A separate AI-translated Vietnamese/AI-silver pilot uses \VISilverTrainN{} training, \VISilverDevN{} development and \VISilverTestN{} test pairs. Frozen fusion reaches \VISilverFusionFOne\% macro-F1 and \VISilverFusionRecall\% request recall. A CUDA DistilBERT fine-tuning replay averages \VISilverFineFOne\% macro-F1 and \VISilverFineRecall\% request recall across three seeds on the same test set. Native-Vietnamese data, independent human gold, information extraction and application fusion remain unvalidated.
 
 In weak-network simulations with bandwidth of 50 kbit/s and a round-trip time of 600 ms, both metadata-only and compressed-image modes succeeded in 257/257 attempts (100\%), compared with 230/257 (89.49\%) for original images. The two modes transmitting less data achieved higher transmission success rates than original images under the tested conditions. Each mode was measured separately on a computer; transmission over real mobile networks requires further validation.
 
